+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an [RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386)
+and returns a new JSON value without changing either input. Object members set to `null` in the patch
+are removed; arrays and other JSON values replace their targets.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+applyMergePatch({ title: "draft", published: false }, { title: "final", published: null });
+// { title: "final" }
+```
